{"id":"fb8c84fc67a63623","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set.md","title":"ZFC Top4 Regular Closed Set","display":"df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set — ZFC Top4 Regular Closed Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set"],"display":"df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set — ZFC Top4 Regular Closed Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set — ZFC Top4 Regular Closed Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ac97ecaeb21258a\" href=\"?note=9ac97ecaeb21258a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"94cf422187df8d8e\" href=\"?note=94cf422187df8d8e\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,F,I\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,F,I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,F,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,I,F)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,F,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,I,F)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The interior and closure are linked through their canonical output\npredicates, so the equation and all topology typing are explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9ac97ecaeb21258a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-top5-closure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md","status":"resolved","id":"94cf422187df8d8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-top5-interior.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau,F,I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}closed\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau,F)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\;\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Interior}_S(X,\\tau,F,I)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5Closure}_S(X,\\tau,I,F)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1095,"backlinks":[{"id":"a72a733509ac2297","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularClosedSet}_S$ (regular-closed-set predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3577","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set.md|58-df-zfc-top4-regular-closed-set]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","9ac97ecaeb21258a","94cf422187df8d8e"]}